        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "All is prepared. Come Matins, the people will take... take their final communion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Will your strings... lament for me? Or will they celebrate me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am clueless about music, Arturia. Just as I cannot understand you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here you stand, and here I empathize with you, yet you seem a total blank.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_490_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am no more than free to perform according to Your Excellency's will. My music is but a mirror.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_923_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A mirror... hah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Abbot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_dishes"
    },
    {
        "text": "The elderly abbot lifts a porcelain tray, his hands quivering amidst string's overtones."
    },
    {
        "text": "He appears as if wrestling with the sound that echoes throughout the dark, awaiting their end."
    },
    {
        "text": "He was still young when the sounds of paradise arose in the abbey years and years ago, so young that his reflection in the fountain did not yet show a single hair of white."
    },
    {
        "text": "Wild fowls were drawn to these roving soils, fluttering through skies rich with organ chords, flying for the square. In his old age, the last abbot handed the monastery down to him, Cleric Stefano, the youngest of them all."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'You must be their keeper, that they live in Paradise.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "And how? How would I see them stay in Paradise?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Abbot Torregrossa shuts his eyes. Storied is his life."
    },
    {
        "text": "The strings continue to echo, echo, echo. And then\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "He lets his hands go."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bottlebroken"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.7,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_490_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Ah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "text": "How painful. So this is your choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arturia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
