    },
    {
        "text": "From behind the sealed chapel entrance comes the muffled sound of speech."
    },
    {
        "text": "Federico stands in the spacious hall for a while, listening, then turns to walk upstairs."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
