    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How're things in there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Communion should be over by now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it as bad in there as I think?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Signs point to yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn. How's Federico?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unreachable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Church of the Deep doesn't breed pushovers for monsters. Does he know that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone needs to do the work. Status on Lemuen and Serpilia?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_355_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "They got your message and went underground to investigate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Oren"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright. That means the trickiest job of all is all ours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_372_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's open up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Richele"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
