        "g": 0.2,
        "b": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.4,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 0.2,
        "b": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 0.03,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 0.2,
        "b": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_flapradio",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_924_1#4$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "Federico never gives more warning than needed. The gun in his hands simply serves the place of speech."
    },
    {
        "text": "Cl\u00e9ment has not collapsed."
    },
    {
        "text": "The wasting man clutches at his arm, where all feeling is lost, and gives a bitter smile."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Destruction of lighter confirmed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_924_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why... won't you kill me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why go to the bother of aiming for the lighter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1032_excu2_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your actions have not directly led to the deaths of any Lateran citizens. The law would not sentence you to death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Federico"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_924_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The law... So many years I've lived here, hearkening to His Excellency's guidance, following your law.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "text": "I feel its bind in ordinary times... Yet in chaos, in the time we need it most, it disappears without a trace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "text": "There was some point where the music of Seniora Arturia became all I could even hear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
    {
        "text": "Senior Federico, is it the law of Laterano that wants to save me... or is it you, yourself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cl\u00e9ment"
    },
